pe":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Suggested board inquiries (not a mandatory approval standard):**\n\n**Selection**\n- Why this exchange and LMM? What alternatives were weighed, and on what criteria (spreads, quoting obligations, fees, incentives)?\n- Any conflicts, such as affiliations, revenue sharing or listing-related payments?\n- What exchange LMM obligations apply, and what are the performance metrics and exit or replacement terms?\n\n**Relevant-market expertise**\n- Can the LMM demonstrably hedge and price the underlying assets (e.g., foreign, fixed income, derivatives, illiquid holdings)?\n- How does it perform during stress, halts or closed underlying markets?\n- Is it an authorized participant, or does it rely on others for creations and redemptions?\n\n**Capital and seed**\n- How much LMM seed is planned, for how long, and on what redemption terms?\n- What asset level is expected after the seed leaves?\n- How will disclosures and viability assessments avoid treating temporary market-maker seed as lasting investor demand?","ttft_ms":1432,"type":"result","duration_ms":3890,"uuid":"92dd18d7-840e-4e4f-bb27-8d613fab5921","ttft_stream_ms":1102,"time_to_request_ms":66,"first_content_frame_ms":1102,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
